### And this gives us a very good learning path

| Page            | Main HTML/CSS concepts             |
| --------------- | ---------------------------------- |
| Home            | `header`, `main`, `section`, `div` |
| Login           | Forms, inputs, buttons             |
| Dashboard       | Flexbox, Grid                      |
| Students        | Tables, cards                      |
| Student Details | Layout, typography                 |
| Add Student     | Forms, labels, inputs              |
| Teachers        | Reusable components                |
| Courses         | Cards/tables                       |
| Attendance      | Tables, status badges              |
| Fees            | Tables, statistics                 |
| Settings        | Forms                              |

**I suggest we don't create all these pages at once.** We'll build **Page 2 — Login** next, and while doing it I'll explain exactly why we use each `div`, `section`, `form`, `label`, `input`, etc. Then we'll connect the Login → Dashboard visually.
